('bunong-vn','AMO',1,1,0,'heading',$b$Nau Phat Dôih Ma Phung Chiau Meng (Kô̆ 1 jêh ri 2) Nau Mbơh Lor Rdâng Đah Damas, Gaxa, Tir, Phung Êđôm Jêh Ri Phung Amôn$b$),
